      "updated": 1731271135083,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "newNode = Node(5)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nafter = dummyHead.next\n\n// Attach newNode to \"after\" node\nnewNode.next = after\n// Attach \"after\" node to newNode\nafter.prev = newNode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n// Move dummyHead to front of queue\ndummyHead.next = newNode\nnewNode.prev = dummyHead",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "newNode = Node(5)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nafter = dummyHead.next\n\n// Attach newNode to \"after\" node\nnewNode.next = after\n// Attach \"after\" node to newNode\nafter.prev = newNode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n// Move dummyHead to front of queue\ndummyHead.next = newNode\nnewNode.prev = dummyHead",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
